body {

font-family: serif;

font-size: 18px;

line-height: 21px;

color: #FFF;

font-weight: bold;

}

.boldText {

font-weight: bold;

}

</style>

<div class="boldText">Here is bold text</div>

You could also use tags in HTML like this:

<b>Here is bold text</b>

